     fragments in discussion or educational material, with attribution
     and a link to the source.

PROHIBITED without the author's written permission:

  1. Copying, modifying or republishing this project or any part of it,
     verbatim or adapted, for commercial or non-commercial purposes.
  2. Using the source code, markup, design or texts in your own
     projects, templates or products.
  3. Redistributing, reselling or transferring it to third parties.
  4. Using the contents of this repository to train, fine-tune or
     evaluate machine-learning models, or to build datasets.

PERSONAL DATA. This repository contains photographs of the author, his
name and images of certificates carrying personal data. They are
included solely so that the portfolio website works. Extracting,
